artifacts:
  - $route/7.3.acuity.envelope.watch.yield.md

reviews:
  self:
    - slug: has-cadence-and-tripwires
      say: |
        is the watch tier stated with an observation cadence AND concrete
        tripwires that escalate up the envelope? a watch plan with no tripwire is
        an open door to a missed deterioration.
    - slug: has-envelope-closed
      say: |
        is the envelope closed — does every live scenario sit in exactly one
        acuity band (emergency / same-day / watch)? a live scenario in no band is
        a gap; a licensed watch over an un-eliminated catastrophic branch with no
        tripwire is a blocker (rule.require.superposition-until-elimination).
